# tally 2.2.1 P50, the review's Q5 (L §6.1): a base that agrees on 3 with a scenario file on 2
# prints the disagreement's form (review g4 ver/b3 with s2). Before W13: tally 3: this engine runs tally 2.
=== options exit=1
=== b3.tally
model m
  tally 3
  on 2026-04-30
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-06-30

source s "s"
unit PLN: currency minor 0.01
place konto: accounts PLN lives 2025-01-01..
place shop: outside lives 1900-01-01..
input bank: observed
input spare: int

version open
  cite s
  governs always
  known 2026-01-01
  opening[konto] = 10.00 PLN at 2026-01-01 start "s"
  spare = 1

version stmt
  cite s
  governs 2026-01-01..2026-04-30
  known 2026-01-02
  covers konto
  bank[r1] = (on: 2026-02-10, kind: transfers, leg cash from konto to shop amount 50.00 PLN) "a"

ask q: bal(konto, 2026-04-30)
=== s2.tally
scenario s2 over m
  tally 2
  from 2026-03-01

ask q_s2: bal(konto, 2026-03-31) in s2
=== expect
refused: LOAD-VERSION files declare different tally versions
